  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "This newly-built stunning home is the perfect spot to celebrate the vacation you deserve. La Joya Azul was professionally designed/decorated and includes a 6-Seater Golf Cart, 6 Bikes, a Private Heated Pool, and comfortably sleeps 22 guests! This home is conveniently located just a few minute stroll from the beach access and sits on the coveted East end of 30A which is a short cart ride to Alys & Rosemary Beach for some of the best restaurants and shopping 30a has to offer! <br><br>La Joya Azul is a multi-family, luxury vacation home designed for all ages. 6 of the 7 Bedrooms include a King bed, lavish mattress/sheets, and its own ensuite bathroom. It also features Multiple living areas with an open living/cooking/dining floor plan that makes it perfect for entertaining. The top floor is the ideal sanctuary for the kids to enjoy with TV’s, Foosball, and Custom Bunks making for a fun time the kids will never forget! <br><br>Feel like taking a break from the beach, then look no further, as the outdoor oasis will make it hard to leave. Take your choice as you can enjoy the private heated pool, tanning on the sun shelf pool loungers, relaxing in the hot tub, grilling out in the chefs outdoor kitchen, or watching the game from the poolside cabana, La Joya Azul has it all. High-end details surround the home inside and out, creating a true sense of luxury your families will be looking forward to year after year. <br> <br>La Joya Azul is conveniently located 1 mile from a main North/South road (Watersound Parkway) that provides immediate access Highway 98, which allows the ability to travel East towards Panama City Beach/Pier Park for the shopping, movie theaters and more, or West, towards Destin…not to mention the direct access to the new Publix just minutes away that also includes a liquor store and new restaurants coming! If you drove your electric car this way, then no need to bring a charger, as we have a J1772 electric charger onsite in the garage waiting for you!<br><br>Here at Modern Beach Vacation Rentals, we strive for perfection with our attention to detail and level of customer service that no other group in town will match. We hope you choose this property, as we’ll do all we can to make sure you have an amazing and memorable vacation!<br><br>POOL DIMENSIONS: 11 feet x 19 feet 3-5 ft deep<br><br>POOL HEAT<br>A $50.00 per day fee is added to reservations booked between October 1st - April 30th for pool and hot tub heat. If you prefer an unheated pool and hot tub, contact us after booking and the fees will be refunded. <br><br>PLEASE NOTE: Pools cannot be heated if it is below 52 degrees. We will do our best to keep you informed of the forecast during your stay and refund you if conditions do not allow for this. Pool and Hot Tub heat is not available May 1 - October 1. Jets/Bubblers are still available.<br><br>You will find everything you need in the property to make the most of your time on the Emerald Coast. We offer a starter kit of premium, eco-friendly guest amenities including: Shampoo, Conditioner, Body and Face Soap, Toilet Paper, Facial Tissues, Dish Soap, Dishwasher Pods, Laundry Detergent, Paper Towels, Trash Bags, Dish Sponge, Bath Towels, and Bed linens.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "La Joya Azul, 7 Bedrooms, Heated Pool, Hot Tub, 6 Seat Golf Cart, & Bikes!!!"
        }
      ],
